                <note rend="inline" type="source">211.18/18: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Costa Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Thurston</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San José</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-01-21T11:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 21,
                                1922—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received January 22—5:25
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>146. Department’s instruction number 53. Signed extradition treaty this morning
                    with the Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thurston</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
